<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - GRIFFIN HALF YEAR SHR FLAT, DIV UP.</title>
<headline>TABLE - GRIFFIN HALF YEAR SHR FLAT, DIV UP.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended June 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - headline		25.3	  vs 25.4</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 7.0	   vs 6.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   18.94	 vs 19.02</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   19.51	 vs 20.34</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   9.00	  vs 12.46</p>
<p>    Turnover		  98.59	 vs 105.86</p>
<p>Div payable Sept 17</p>
<p>on register Aug 29</p>
<p>Full name: Griffin Shipping</p>
<p>NOTE - The firm said in a statement that it was on the hunt for opportunities to buy modern second hand ships.</p>
<p>Grifin added that in current market conditions it expected earnings in U.S. dollar terms in the second half to be similar to that of the first half, while rand earnings would depend upon currency exchange rates.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
